&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own change control&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 67.4686%; height: 86.7812px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Run the review of engineering change requests and the change board as configuration authority. Release your first configuration item data list end to end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 86.7812px;&quot;&gt;
