&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Close gaps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 67.4686%; height: 86.7812px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Put status accounting in place, set up the record of which document revision each customer holds, and release an updated CM plan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;height: 86.7812px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 16.4513%; height: 86.7812px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Month 6–12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 16.2664%; height: 86.7812px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Run your first audit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style=&quot;width: 67.4686%; height: 86.7812px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Run the first functional and physical configuration audit with Production and Quality, and extend the CM process to the next product variant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
